;c_ccflopsy16_ia
;avance-version (21/09/15)
;CC-TOCSY
;2D sequence with
;   homonuclear Hartman-Hahn transfer using FLOPSY16 
;      sequence for mixing
;on/off resonance 13C pulses using hard and shaped pulses
;phase sensitive (t1)
;using DIPAP scheme for virtual decoupling
;(use parameterset C_CCFLOPSY16_IA)
;
;W. Bermel, I. Bertini,L. Duma, I.C. Felli, L. Emsley,  R. Pierattelli,
;   P.R. Vasos, Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 44, 3089-3092 (2005)
;(L. Duma, S. Hediger, A. Lesage & L. Emsley,
;   J. Magn. Reson. 164, 187-195 (2003) )
;(A. Eletsky, O.Moreira, H. Kovacs & K. Pervushin, 
